# Qualified spellings Java's profile only ever carried in BARE form. The
# platform owns the QUALIFIED name (§3 of javakotlinmigration.md); the bare
# `StringBuilder` / `OutOfMemoryError` stay in the Java profile as its idiom.
# Without these the tree registers no `Type` node for them, so `__types` is
# never stamped and `StringBuilder.class.isInstance(sb)` answers false.
"java.lang.StringBuilder"    = ["common", "java.stringbuilder_new"]
